    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Baxter Real Estate are delighted to present to the market this well-maintained three-bedroom mid-terrace family home, extending to approximately 82 sq.m. (883 sq.ft.). Ideally positioned on a quiet cul-de-sac in a mature residential development, this property offers bright, well-proportioned accommodation together with a private rear garden and off-street parking.\n\nOn entering the property, you are welcomed into a spacious living room featuring a large picture window, laminate flooring and a feature open fireplace, creating a bright and comfortable living space.\n\nTo the rear of the property is a generous open-plan kitchen/dining room fitted with a range of wall and floor units, tiled splashback and tiled flooring. The dining area opens directly onto the private north-west facing rear garden, providing an ideal space for outdoor entertaining and relaxation. The garden also benefits from a concrete storage shed.\n\nUpstairs, there are three well-proportioned bedrooms, each with carpeted flooring and built-in wardrobes, providing excellent storage. A fully tiled family bathroom, complete with an electric shower, wash hand basin and WC, completes the first-floor accommodation.This superb home enjoys an excellent location close to a wealth of amenities including Blanchardstown Shopping Centre, Connolly Hospital, the National Aquatic Centre and numerous sporting and recreational facilities. A wide selection of primary and secondary schools, together with TU Dublin Blanchardstown Campus, are all within easy reach.\n\nThe property is conveniently located just minutes from the M50 motorway, providing easy access to Dublin City Centre, Dublin Airport and the national road network. Excellent public transport links are available with numerous Dublin Bus routes nearby, while both Castleknock and Coolmine train stations are within easy reach.\n\nThis is an excellent opportunity for first-time buyers, families or investors seeking a well-located home in one of Dublin 15`s most established residential areas.\n\nPlease note that all descriptions, dimensions, photographs and references to condition are provided for guidance only and are believed to be correct. Intending purchasers should satisfy themselves by inspection or otherwise as to the accuracy of the information provided. Baxter Real Estate have not tested any appliances, and no warranty is given or implied in relation to their condition or operation."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Living Room - 4.06m (13'4\") x 3.03m (9'11\")\nLaminate flooring with a feature open fireplace and a door leading to the kitchen. A large picture window fills the room with natural light, creating a bright and welcoming living space.\n\nKitchen - 5.02m (16'6\") x 3m (9'10\")\nTiled floor with a range of wall and floor units, tiled splashback, and sliding doors opening onto the private north-west facing rear garden.\n\nBedroom 1 - 3m (9'10\") x 3.02m (9'11\")\nCarpeted floor with built-in wardrobes, providing excellent storage.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.07m (10'1\") x 3.01m (9'11\")\nCarpeted floor with built-in wardrobes.\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.07m (6'9\") x 2.02m (6'8\")\nCarpeted floor with built-in wardrobes.\n\nBathroom - 1.09m (3'7\") x 1.09m (3'7\")\nFully tiled, fitted with a bath, electric shower, wash hand basin and WC.\n\nNotice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> 3-bedroom mid-terrace home extending to approx. 82 sq.m. (883 sq.ft.) </li><li> Quiet cul-de-sac location in a mature residential development </li><li> Open-plan kitchen/dining room with direct access to the rear garden </li><li> Private north-west facing rear garden with concrete storage shed </li><li> Three generous bedrooms with built-in wardrobes </li><li> Fully tiled family bathroom with electric shower </li><li> Gas-fired central heating with Double-glazed uPVC windows throughout </li><li> Large cobblelock driveway providing excellent off-street parking </li><li> Minutes from Blanchardstown Shopping Centre, Connolly Hospital and the National Aquatic Centre </li><li> Excellent transport links with easy access to the M50, Dublin Bus routes, Castleknock and Coolmine t</li></ul>"
      },
      {
